<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Leaf Shield</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Class: Druid (guild level 47)
Mana: 40
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast leaf shield
</pre>
<p>The druid who masters this spell shall never be without defence. The 
caster cups their hands and chants 'Folius Magnum', and a nearby leaf 
falls into them and grows into a large shield. Wear it like any shield.
</p><p>The better your skill in the spell and your divine power, the finer the 
shield: its craftsmanship and its magic both grow with them (see <a cmd='#'>Help 
Craftsmanship</a>). It keeps as long as you carry or wear it; leave it on 
the ground, and within ten minutes it shrinks back into a normal leaf.
</p><p>It needs leaves: it can't be cast indoors, on or under water, or on snow, 
slush or ice. You must be standing.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
